{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-alef-noon-residence","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"alef-noon-residence-al-bait-al-duwaliy-jumeirah-village-circle-jvc","about":"Alef Noon Residence is a premium residential complex by the developer Al Bait Al Duwaliy Real Estate Development, located in the prestigious Jumeirah Village Circle. The 16-story building offers stunning views of Dubai.The building features a modern design characterized by elegant shapes with large landscaped terraces. Alef Noon Residence offers studios, 1- and 2-bedroom apartments with a maid’s room for sale. The one-bedroom residences have two large terraces, while the two-bedroom units have three spacious terraces.The interiors are finished with high-quality materials, including artificial wooden floors, Greek folding door systems, and top-brand sanitary ware and kitchen equipment, all with long-term warranties. Each residence comes with a parking space, and there are several parking spots for electric vehicles. The complex is equipped with an access control system and intercoms.Residents of Alef Noon Residence can relax in the temperature-controlled pool and maintain their health in the well-equipped gym. The excellent location of the complex between Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Street and Al Khail Street, near the Expo Site, ensures easy access to shopping centers, restaurants, and entertainment. Circle Mall is just a 5-minute drive away.Thanks to its exceptional location, high-quality finishes, and well-thought-out amenities, Alef Noon Residence is an excellent option for both living and long-term investment.","price":951939,"title":"Alef Noon Residence","bitrix":{"id":884,"pf_id":"are.2.12698","source":null,"project_id":"Alef Noon Residence","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Alef Noon Residence","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"AlBait Al Duwaliy","project_location":"Jumeirah Village Circle"},"i